# Arc's window is at least 926 pt, so its 417 pt Library always leaves the page 509 pt. Cra's
# window goes down to 640 pt, where a fixed 417 pt Library left the page 223 pt. Below 926 the
# Library gives way, down to 320 pt, and follows the window while it resizes.
# promise: #302
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
from://debug?windowSize=640x800
from://open?url=${PAGE}?n=one
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
from://action/viewDownloads
expect-log library opens 320 pt wide beside a \d+ pt tab sidebar
from://debug?windowSize=900x800
expect-log library is 391 pt wide in a 900 pt window
from://debug?windowSize=1280x800
expect-log library is 417 pt wide in a 1280 pt window
